        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "光 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "光 can restrict an activity to only the named one, often critically. It does not mean light in this use.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "不要光说不做。",
                "pinyin": "bùyào guāng shuō bù zuò 。",
                "meaning": "Do not merely talk without acting.",
                "audio": "a9c8a7163c191e20504b111fe258fe741504efa8de23da47a83b06aeb5e327f1"
              },
              {
                "text": "光喝茶不行。",
                "pinyin": "guāng hē chá bù xíng 。",
                "meaning": "Just drinking tea will not do.",
                "audio": "9dcd35833a79ff32d866b16e6d55351534fcc3f279c759fddc2e008634420dc3"
